OgpUBGQSbaK0dy8tP5vpmZab/68g==","buildDate":"Sep 01, 2026","releaseTimestamp":"2026-09-01T07:00:00.00Z","title":"Controller Clock","wiki":"https://github.com/jenkinsci/controller-clock-plugin/tree/main","excerpt":"<p>Controller Clock shows the Jenkins controller time in the global header.<\/p>\n<p>The display is synced from Jenkins, so it reflects controller time rather than the browser clock.<\/p> Features\n<ul>\n <li>Displays controller time in the Jenkins header<\/li>\n <li>Updates from Jenkins on a refresh interval<\/li>\n <li>Uses controller time, not browser time<\/li>\n <li>Shows the active Jenkins timezone in the tooltip<\/li>\n <li>No plugin-specific configuration<\/li>\n <li>No telemetry or outbound requests<\/li>\n<\/ul> Requirements\n<ul>\n <li>Jenkins 2.541.3 or newer<\/li>\n<\/ul> Usage\n<p>Once installed, the clock is visible in the Jenkins header. Hover over it to see the full time and the timezone Jenkins is using.<\/p> Privacy and Network Behavior\n<p>Controller Clock is a local Jenkins feature. It does not send telemetry, analytics, or other outbound Internet traffic. The browser only calls the Jenkins controller on the same origin to sync clock state.<\/p>","requiredCore":"2.541.3","dependencies":[{"name":"ionicons-api","version":"94.vcc3065403257","optional":false}],"developers":[],"groupId":"io.jenkins.plugins","gav":"io.jenkins.plugins:controller-clock:0.1.17.v069e43fc2d63"},"docker-slaves":{"name":"docker-slaves","url":"https://jenkins-updates.cloudbees.com/download/plugins/docker-slaves/1.0.7/docker-slaves.hpi","version":"1.0.7","sha1":"szOSQZPG+7hvCbn306JphF6JgJg=","sha256":"DI0tpxuEJbFtJfbJSSTxHvHiOPcm5MPdLHPHy6Cws9g=","sha512":"NyqvDJqyL2V6Wn5KfYdvT0AHW1omEA1xoqmGRngDDqRsZWlDgakibJ0m7lOGOpUbbY410sDNkjU4czwsmadG+A==","buildDate":"Jul 24, 2017","releaseTimestamp":"2017-07-24T07:00:00.00Z","title":"Docker Slaves Plugin","wiki":"https://wiki.jenkins-ci.org/display/JENKINS/Docker+Slaves+Plugin","excerpt":"Uses <a href=\"https://www.docker.com/